    "text": "AlphaTech manages a cloud storage server platform generating $500,000 in average monthly revenue. A risk analysis identifies a potential DDoS attack that could incapacitate servers, reducing data center capacity by 40%. What is the Single Loss Expectancy (SLE) for this specific threat?",
