    "id": "SY0-701-CQ-28-057",
    "chapterIndex": 27,
    "text": "Scenario: A security administrator analyzes an automated SIEM report (similar to the examples in Chapter 22) that highlights 15 failed login attempts from a single external IP address within a 10-minute window, followed by three large data transfers to an external destination. Recognizing this as a potential brute-force attack leading to data exfiltration, the administrator consults the incident response playbook. The playbook mandates immediate system isolation, notification of legal teams, and execution of containment steps. Which combination of data sources and procedural tools is being utilized?",
